<p>The BBC said it will cut between 1,800 and 2,000 jobs over the next two years as it deals with a budget squeeze. The move underscores the pressure on publicly funded media groups as they try to protect core services in a tougher financial climate.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/Qni75VDeE7yZEqut9skLVW8HEpoAjPE7uTHd-_CTJDD3Dcud5Ne_KmLX9Yp2ZihNmlz9R7K_DOx5GcHUKx8_S73aQW-p9tx3ypy-BmY_iXgTGWZB3vC9zfccBXt2AUW-hYMVPdo5STCcHTlHmApgqJ_Q1MtTPLf-0npjIbtqn0-hHg' alt='The headquarters of the British Broadcasting Corporation in London.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Cost target: Euronews reported that the restructuring aims to save €575 million in operating costs, giving the cuts a clear financial goal.</li><li>Rare move: The Straits Times said this is the BBC’s biggest round of redundancies in almost 15 years, making it a notable break from the broadcaster’s recent history.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Euronews analysis: Euronews framed the announcement around the BBC’s licence-fee funding model, highlighting the tension between cutting costs and maintaining a broad public-service role. (<a href='http://www.euronews.com/2026/04/15/bbc-to-cut-up-to-2000-jobs-in-next-two-years-to-save-575ml-from-operating-costs'>Euronews</a>)</li><li>New York Times: The New York Times said the reductions amount to about one in 10 staff, casting the plan as a workforce reset that goes well beyond trimming a few departments. (<a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/04/15/world/europe/bbc-job-cuts.html'>The New York Times</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/europe/bbc-to-cut-2000-jobs-uk-media'>Britain’s BBC broadcaster to cut up to 2,000 jobs in next two years</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='http://www.euronews.com/2026/04/15/bbc-to-cut-up-to-2000-jobs-in-next-two-years-to-save-575ml-from-operating-costs'>BBC to cut up to 2,000 jobs in next two years to save €575ml from operating costs</a> - euronews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.lemonde.fr/en/economy/article/2026/04/15/bbc-announces-up-to-2-000-layoffs-in-next-two-years_6752465_19.html'>BBC announces up to 2,000 layoffs in next two years</a> - lemonde.fr</li><li><a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/04/15/world/europe/bbc-job-cuts.html'>BBC Announces Plan to Cut Around 2,000 Jobs</a> - nytimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cyv11lryv7ro'>The BBC announces that it will cut between 1,800 and 2,000 jobs, around 1-in-10 employees, citing the need to tackle &quot;significant financial pressures&quot;.</a> - bbc.co.uk</li></ul>